OL,3,GNEWSAIllegal goods and dog seized in
OL,4,Ahigh street raids
OL,5,
OL,6,FIllegal tobacco, a suspected dangerous
OL,7,Fdog and counterfeit vapes were among
OL,8,Fthe seizures made during an operation
OL,9,Fin the West Midlands.
OL,11,FSeven high street shops in Lye, Dudley,
OL,12,Fwere raided on Wednesday as part of a
OL,13,Fpolice and council crackdown on illicit
OL,14,Ftrading.
OL,16,FAlong with finding the illegal products
OL,17,Fand the dog, officers discovered some
OL,18,Fof the the electricity in the stores
OL,19,Fhad also been tampered with.
